      "writtenOn": "2025-03-05T22:01:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is the long term solution I mentioned in the bug. The newly introduced threads don\u0027t follow the convention of the shimmed tasks in this `ec_app_main()` function; this is not wrong, just more like Zephyr, but it breaks some EC-EFS2 assumptions. Moving forward, I think we needs to eliminate the shimmed tasks and this `ec_app_main()`. You can see that the above init functions EC-EFS2 depending on need to be moved to `SYS_INIT()` or integrated with the device driver in a more Zephyr-compliant way. This effort is not trivial.",
